AB  - A business solution architecture creates a detailed blueprint for a specific business solution or project. It involves extensive analysis of business processes, goals, pain points, and required resources, and aims to ensure alignment with organizational strategy, standards, regulatory requirements, and existing capabilities. The role includes collaborating with stakeholders and technical teams to design, implement, monitor, and refine scalable, cost-effective solutions that meet business objectives.
